        "notes": "Plan lists only ConfigurationSettings and UserSettings ports; graph config options follow user settings. Statements run through the ConfigurationSettings and UserSettings ports and their DBAL adapters (#867). Caches, defaults, hooks and the remote-collector write stay in this function. The db_* helpers still run before Composer loads and for argument types outside the port. The goldens pass unchanged through this wrapper. Fixed: a user id that is not an integer or a digit string from 0 to 16777215 is now rejected before the query and the default is returned; it is not logged because cacti_log() reads a user setting through this function (#887)."
